<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea AFMC to seek 20,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean.</title>
<headline>S.Korea AFMC to seek 20,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's state-run Agricultural and Fishery Marketing Corp (AFMC) said on Thursday it will invite tenders on Friday to buy 20,000 tonnes of U.S. No.1 soybean.  </p>
<p>An AFMC official said shipment was set for April 25-May 15 from the U.S. Gulf.</p>
<p>Arrival was scheduled by June 20 to the western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
